# Anchored to the context root: the top-level ROS2 colcon workspace src/ (guide_mate_explorer,
# guide_mate_perception) -- NOT a bare "src/", which (gitignore-style unanchored matching) would
# also match world/src and world-client/src and silently break Docker builds that COPY those
# (found during Task 5.1's world/Dockerfile work: `COPY world/src` failed against this context
# until this was anchored).
/src/
.git/
claude-conversations/
Research/
rviz/
